OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces #14m schools budget
OL,4,Ashortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's school budget deficit is
OL,7,Fprojected to hit #14m.
OL,9,FNorth Tyneside Council's projected
OL,10,Fyear-end deficit is largely made up of
OL,11,Flosses caused by the recently shut
OL,12,FMonkseaton High School which is
OL,13,Festimated to have lost about #8.6m.
OL,15,FThe authority's resources director
OL,16,FDavid Mason said school funding was
OL,17,Flargely driven by pupil numbers.
OL,19,F"[This] is why ensuring the right
OL,20,Fnumber of school places in the right
OL,21,Flocations remains an important part of
OL,22,Fthe council's planning," he said.
